        "cos x",
        "−cos x",
        "sin x",
        "−sin x"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explain": "cos(180° − x) = −cos x, because cosine is negative in the second quadrant.",
      "explainAf": "cos(180° − x) = −cos x, omdat kosinus in die tweede kwadrant negatief is."
    },
